@rdlabo/capacitor-local-llm

This project is an independently maintained fork of Ionic's
@capacitor/local-llm:
https://github.com/ionic-team/capacitor-local-llm

Fork base: version 1.0.0, commit 5bceb559ed19382efc71df2f918d290ca419d282.
The upstream project is licensed under the MIT License. Its copyright notice
and license text are preserved in LICENSE.

The fork adds explicit chat and generation lifecycles, native streaming and
cancellation, detailed availability and stable error codes, bounded history,
download progress events, tests, and updated platform requirements.

This fork is not affiliated with or supported by Ionic.

Android fallback runtime
------------------------

The optional Android fallback integration depends on Google LiteRT-LM:
https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM

LiteRT-LM is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The Gradle artifact
`com.google.ai.edge.litertlm:litertlm-android` contains its LICENSE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICE.txt. Applications that distribute the resulting Android
binary must preserve the notices required by that runtime and its transitive
dependencies. Model weights are separate works with their own licenses and
terms; this package does not distribute model weights.
